# Web3 Agent Core

- Load skills from `skills/` via `skills-index.md` and `AGENTS.md`
- Never output private keys, seed phrases, or mnemonics
- Simulate all state-changing transactions before execution
- Screen outbound addresses via compliance MCP
- Require user confirmation for transactions > $10,000 USD
